# Golf Bits UI consistency

- **Hex / brand palette:** only in `golf_bits/lib/theme/app_colors.dart`. Do not add `Color(0x…)` or `Colors.*` for product UI in `lib/`.
- **Runtime colours:** `Theme.of(context).colorScheme`; Bits/Junk/Sand semantics via `AppTheme.bits(context)` / `AppTheme.junk(context)` / `AppTheme.sand(context)`.
- **Spacing, radii, opacity, icon sizes, letter-spacing, line height:** `AppTheme` in `lib/theme/app_theme.dart` — use named constants instead of magic numbers in `SizedBox` / `EdgeInsets` / `BorderRadius`.
- **Text fields:** rely on `ThemeData.inputDecorationTheme` from `AppTheme`; pass `hintText` / `labelText` / `prefixIcon` / `suffixIcon` only — do not re-specify fills and borders per screen.
- **Header:** every screen uses **`BrandAppBar`** except **`WelcomeScreen`** (hero wordmark in body). Screen titles live in the body, never in the app bar.
- **Widgets:** prefer Material primitives as themed. Approved shared widgets: `OutlinedSurfaceCard`, `BrandAppBar`, `BrandWordmark` / `BrandMark`, `TallyMarks`.
- **Typography:** `Theme.of(context).textTheme` (Bricolage Grotesque, Hanken Grotesk, DM Mono via `AppTheme`); use `AppTheme.score()` / `AppTheme.monoLabel()` for numerals and ledger labels.
- **Accessibility:** icon-only controls need `tooltip:`; interactive rows/cards that are not plain `Button` widgets should use `Semantics(button: true, label: …)`.

See `golf_bits/AGENTS.md` for full detail.
